es YubiKit’s backend;"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"omitting the level uses the selected handler’s level. Changes apply to existing sessions,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"though logs already in progress may use the previous settings."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YubiKit’s configuration does not affect other libraries. To share your app’s backend,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pass its factory explicitly; global "},{"code":"LoggingSystem.bootstrap","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" does not select YubiKit’s backend."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Factories may run concurrently and must not log through YubiKit themselves."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Traffic logging","level":3,"anchor":"Traffic-logging"},{"code":["Logging.configure(logLevel: .trace)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Raw traffic and SCP plaintext logs require ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"YubiKit to be compiled with ","type":"text"},{"code":"DEBUG","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Neither configuration nor a custom backend can enable them in other builds.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Custom connections are responsible for their own traffic logging.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Warning","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Debug logs can include account names and credential identifiers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Trace logs can include PINs, credentials, and cryptographic keys. Protect or redact logs before sharing them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"warning"},{"type":"heading","text":"Custom backends","level":3,"anchor":"Custom-backends"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Labels identify categories, such as ","type":"text"},{"type